3. Abstract Factory Pattern

          Creates related objects together.
          
          Example:    Different UI families
                              
                    Windows:
                              Button
                              Checkbox
                              Textbox
                    
                    Mac:
                              MacButton
                              MacCheckbox
                              MacTextbox
                    
                    Factory:
                              GUIFactory Can generate entire UI family.

          Used In: 
                    Cross-platform frameworks
                    UI libraries

