4. Builder Pattern
          Purpose:   Create complex objects step-by-step.

          Problem:
              User user = new User("John",
                             25,
                             "Pune",
                             "India",
                             true,
                             false,
                             true);

          Hard to read.

          Solution:
                    User user =
                    User.builder()
                        .name("John")
                        .age(25)
                        .city("Pune")
                        .build();

           Lombok
                    @Builder
                    public class User {
                    }
                    Common Interview Question

          Difference between Builder and Factory?
                              
          Builder	          Factory
          Complex object	Object creation
          Step-by-step	One step











